   "stem": {
      "text": "Let \\( f \\) be the function that satisfies \\( f''(x) = 2\\left(f(x)\\right)^{2} - x \\), with \\( f(0) = -1 \\) and \\( f'(0) = 2 \\). Find the third-degree Taylor polynomial for \\( f \\) about \\( x = 0 \\)."
